Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The capital of the Meeres Empire{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is the center of the \Nnation's government,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.67,0:00:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the heart of its culture,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and its financial center.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At some point, the people \Nbegan to call it...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.05,0:00:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"the most prosperous city in the world."{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.13,0:00:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So this is Rayde Street.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.97,0:00:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The eunuchs were saying there's \Na popular singer here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.83,0:00:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I will accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I gave Zoey more work to thank her \Nfor her help with her home village.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:00:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She does good work, and she pays \Nattention to the smallest details.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's really grown up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can never have too many brilliant \Npeople working for you, after all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.29,0:01:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}We drown in love{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}We long for affection and feel sorrow{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.22,0:01:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Tell me, why do we meet{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.95,0:01:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}When we are doomed to part?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.85,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}When the feckless feelings that well up{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.92,0:01:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Ultimately turn into pain{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.90,0:01:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Can it be blamed on an \Nimpossible future?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.31,0:01:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I believe her name is Alichey?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.43,0:01:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see. She isn't bad.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.31,0:01:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her technique has room for improvement,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.92,0:01:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I can tell she sings earnestly \Nand takes it seriously.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.88,0:02:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's clearly a conscientious girl.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.63,0:02:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I try to drown my memories \Nof the one I love...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.05,0:02:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you wasting \Ntime singing in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.48,0:02:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sir, please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.35,0:02:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You ain't gonna earn enough to pay \Noff your daddy's debt that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.96,0:02:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.86,0:02:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But this is all I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me explain the best \Nway for a woman to make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.41,0:02:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.80,0:03:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell d'you want?\NGo suck on your mommy's teat, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Law 67, Article 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.97,0:03:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It is illegal to make children \Nassume their parents' debts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.41,0:03:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Making her repay her father's debt,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.79,0:03:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and ordering her to sell her \Nbody to do it, is a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.13,0:03:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you mess with me, you little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.82,0:03:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,– Ow!\N– Who the hell is this kid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wish to continue?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.09,0:03:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna forget this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.35,0:03:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. If those men return,\Nsend them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A-A prince?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.41,0:04:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That song was very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How much are your living \Nexpenses per month?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I also have my mother's \Ntreatment to pay for, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.21,0:04:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-five rean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.59,0:04:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pay you that much every month, \Nso you can concentrate on singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.25,0:04:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll increase the amount as you improve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.70,0:04:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, please let me hear how it ends.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.57,0:04:46.55,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}BORN BLESSED, SO I'LL\NOBTAIN ULTIMATE POWER
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.17,0:06:04.96,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}EPISODE 2\NTHE BIRTH OF THE SONGSTRESS
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.31,0:06:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.89,0:06:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They called themselves lenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They said they wished \Nto apologize to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.08,0:06:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Finally learned who I was, did they?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.55,0:06:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Send them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them a prince is not someone they \Ncan just see whenever they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.47,0:06:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.68,0:06:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:49.65,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}HENRY ARARAT / FOURTH PRINCE
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.65,0:06:51.04,Default,Sign Overlap,0,0,0,,{\an8}HENRY ARARAT / FOURTH PRINCE\N– Brother Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting an audience to men like \Nthem without a second thought
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.27,0:06:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,would devalue the standing of \Nroyalty and your princedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.76,0:07:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That is also true,\Nbut I had another reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.39,0:07:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not the place. \NPlease, come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.14,0:07:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You want to aid a singer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.75,0:07:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, which is why I felt that letting \Nthem think I was still angry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.57,0:07:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,would stop them from \Nbothering her any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Was her singing that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.29,0:07:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't take her from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.07,0:07:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, I'm impressed you could \Nthink that far ahead at your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Frank and Gary are closer to your \Nage, but they don't think that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.35,0:07:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.91,0:07:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all still children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.95,0:07:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all the teaching he receives, \Nhe still hasn't learned his manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.49,0:07:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He will soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They may be my brothers, but \Nwe have different mothers.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.93,0:07:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But since Henry and Gary \Nhave the same mother,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I suppose they have a different \Nsort of connection.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.47,0:07:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's talk about \Nthat magic sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.95,0:07:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like you've \Nmanaged to master it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.23,0:07:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right. It has its own will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.52,0:08:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you carry it around, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.89,0:08:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it too big for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.68,0:08:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you pull that from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It was hidden in my sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.51,0:08:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It taught me that itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unprecedented.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing was isolated as a national \Ntreasure for two centuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.94,0:08:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and even the records from before \Nthen mentioned nothing of the sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.05,0:08:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You are simply amazing. \NMy hat's off to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.53,0:08:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take this anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get all snotty and \Nignore us, you little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.34,0:08:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.35,0:08:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:09:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you anytime, anyplace, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.22,0:09:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot! Just keep your \Nhead down and apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I unleashed just a tiny bit of its power
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.67,0:09:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and used it to threaten them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.25,0:09:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You really have brought it to heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A warm welcome to you, Prince Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for inviting me, Raydok.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be a fun evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Thirteenth Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks so dignified \Nfor such a young boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.15,0:09:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly the son of His Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:10:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may ask, Your Highness, \Nwhat is that at your waist?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this? It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,a gift from the Crown Prince. \NIt's called Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.46,0:10:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The national treasure?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.11,0:10:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A direct gift from the Crown Prince?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.89,0:10:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, the\NThirteenth Prince's fief is Almeria...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I see! So that's the connection!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hah! I bet it's just a toy replica.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.55,0:10:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Were you angry because \Nits master was insulted?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.65,0:10:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I appreciate your loyalty, \Nbut that was too much.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Most impressive, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.94,0:10:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure everyone here felt very \Nclose to death for a moment there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Such is the power of a national treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.87,0:11:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And Your Highness has won control \Nover that overwhelming power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.05,0:11:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,H-He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A single word from\NHis Highness saved our lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.57,0:11:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It truly is the real thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.05,0:11:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Most impressive,\NThirteenth Imperial Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.96,0:11:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What shall we do about that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.07,0:11:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He has nowhere left to turn anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.99,0:11:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a pleasure to meet you,\NYour Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.62,0:11:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.15,0:11:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Lance Rawlinson, the trader.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.33,0:11:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot thank you enough for the honor \Nof this opportunity you have granted us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.61,0:11:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Byron Alan,\Nthe head of the Alan Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I could not be more delighted \Nto stand in your presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.96,0:12:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I am his daughter, Cyndi Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.17,0:12:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your daughter adopted, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You knew about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.53,0:12:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can tell by looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Alan, you are the second or \Nthird generation, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.25,0:12:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bearing is that of one who \Nwas born into a high rank,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but your daughter lacks that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.17,0:12:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I see! What a keen eye you have!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.34,0:12:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's more, you took in a \Nformer slave as your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You could deduce that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The moment she felt flustered, \Nshe gave me an inquiring look.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's a look unique to people \Nwho have been slaves.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.75,0:12:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I originally bought her as a slave,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.12,0:12:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but she learns very quickly, so I've been \Nteaching her as my adopted daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good. I love stories like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll invite you to my mansion sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.10,0:12:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear more about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.87,0:13:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Of course! With pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.31,0:13:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows when it's time \Nto leave, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.47,0:13:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a clever man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.00,0:13:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If he stayed any longer,\Nhe would invite too much envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.57,0:13:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the first one to be \Nacknowledged by the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.48,0:13:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How I envy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.32,0:13:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another reason I could tell \Nshe wasn't his real daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.46,0:13:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.27,0:13:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been protecting Byron since the \Nfirst time I used the sword as a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl her age would normally \Nbe protected herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,True!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How very perceptive of you \Nto see that from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.10,0:13:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I could not be more \Nimpressed today, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.89,0:14:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.82,0:14:03.71,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}OSCAR ARARAT\NEIGHTH PRINCE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.90,0:14:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.01,0:14:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Just taking a stroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.65,0:14:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a carriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.41,0:14:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You always were an interesting one, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.61,0:14:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, if you have nothing to do,\Nwhy not join me in a treasure hunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.70,0:14:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You meant Cobalt Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.53,0:14:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, have you been here before?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I've only heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They say antiques from all over \Nthe empire can be found here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Plenty of counterfeits, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Finding the real treasures among them is \Nsomething any noble should be able to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.71,0:14:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no luck. We failed today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.45,0:14:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.79,0:15:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How much is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Three rean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this? Did you find a bargain?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.84,0:15:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it just made me a bit curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.21,0:15:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.47,0:15:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the grimoire of Andrea, \Nthe legendary sorcerer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.71,0:15:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The original, at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.07,0:15:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a genuine treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.14,0:15:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Depending on what's in it,\Nyou could get a thousand rean for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.91,0:15:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible! How'd you know what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.01,0:15:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the moment I touched it, a \Nplus was added to my wind stat.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I only bought it for that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.88,0:15:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Plus?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.87,0:15:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.06,0:15:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Only beings with their own \Nwill can add to my stats.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.13,0:15:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means this has...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.68,0:16:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.73,0:16:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a forbidden tome with the \Nsorcerer's soul sealed inside?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.67,0:16:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.84,0:16:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the vengeful spirit of the \Ngreat sorcerer who mastered wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.36,0:16:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Begone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.41,0:16:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes... I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.93,0:17:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Was there any damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine. I aimed it upward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.29,0:17:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was able to make that \Ncall in a mere instant?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When did he become that strong?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.41,0:17:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I run an antique shop on this street.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.34,0:17:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Allan Bardsley.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Having witnessed\NYour Highness's remarkable feat,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.13,0:17:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an article that I \Nwould like you to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I do hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.92,0:17:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ring that, as I'm told, \Nwill only show its true form
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,when its true owner appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.82,0:17:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I have shown it to many people, \Nbut it never responds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it just trash, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.07,0:17:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so myself and tried \Nto get rid of it many times,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.48,0:18:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but it always comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.05,0:18:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It comes back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.32,0:18:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Before I know it, \Nit's back in my store.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.47,0:18:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm quite certain \Nthere's something to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.01,0:18:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Try it on, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Level limit confirmed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.49,0:18:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A voice?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rarity SSS.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Recognized as new owner.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Armorize.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.34,0:18:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's... its true form?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's armor?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no change in my stats.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.81,0:18:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not the same sort of being \Nas that grimoire or Leviathan,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.14,0:18:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but it seems to have many uses.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Allan, I'll take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.13,0:19:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have payment sent to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.13,0:19:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, let me pay for this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.22,0:19:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider it as a gift from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.13,0:19:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,First a magic sword, then magic armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.65,0:19:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There really is something \Ndifferent about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.41,0:19:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want me to see you home?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.53,0:19:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, someone is coming for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.82,0:19:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Die, you little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.35,0:19:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.66,0:19:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.31,0:19:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,– Damn it!\N– You again? Do you never give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.30,0:19:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,– Settle down!\N– You again? Do you never give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.98,0:19:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,Too short (780ms),Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.16,0:19:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I linked this gift from \Nyou with Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.34,0:19:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to have reacted to his \Nhostility with automatic defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.25,0:20:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Automatic defense?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already mastered it? Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.59,0:20:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That lender's done for \Nafter he attacked me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.33,0:20:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll tell her that later \Nso she won't worry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.11,0:20:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that was some nice singin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.30,0:20:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Lemme pour you a drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.97,0:20:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.92,0:20:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off! I saw this little lady first!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that hurts! You wanna fight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.57,0:20:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh! Moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.52,0:20:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.96,0:20:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That was some amazing sword work!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.19,0:20:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You dolt! That's one of the princes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.87,0:20:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.89,0:20:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.60,0:20:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let guys like them in here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.45,0:21:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's customers like them \Nwho keep my business alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.18,0:21:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of my business, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.49,0:21:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.99,0:21:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll purchase your business, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.23,0:21:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,Too short (770ms),What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,Too short (760ms),Zoey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.28,0:21:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,One thousand rean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That should cover it, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.49,0:21:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes! Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.48,0:21:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um, Your Highness...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to repay you \Nfor doing all this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.05,0:21:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.23,0:21:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What I want from you is your music.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.27,0:21:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All you need to do is keep singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.82,0:21:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You like my singing that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.25,0:21:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I see your potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want the emperor to hear you someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Devote yourself to singing until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.03,0:21:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.14,0:22:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, please listen to one more song.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.47,0:22:15.16,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}TRANSLATION: BECKY COTTRILL\NTIMING: EDGAR CRUZ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.73,0:22:22.38,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}EDITING: GABRIELLA ALABANZA\NQUALITY CONTROL: S BILYEU
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.00,0:22:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My judgment was spot on.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.28,0:22:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This, right here,\Nis the real treasure.{\i0}
